OL,3,GNEWSADairy farmers still producing milk
OL,4,Aat a loss despite rising prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers are operating at a loss despite
OL,7,Fa rise in farmgate milk prices, the
OL,8,Fvice-president of the Welsh Dairy Show
OL,9,Fhas warned.
OL,11,FDyfrig Griffiths, who farms in
OL,12,FLlangoedmor near Cardigan, said farmers
OL,13,Fwere still supplying milk below the
OL,14,Fcost of production.
OL,16,FFarming unions have called for
OL,17,Fcertainty and a long-term strategy "to
OL,18,Frealise the significant potential of
OL,19,Fthe Welsh dairy sector".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
