OL,3,GNEWSADairy farmers still producing milk
OL,4,Aat a loss despite rising prices
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said it offered a
OL,7,Frange of "support suitable for dairy
OL,8,Ffarms to enhance their financial and
OL,9,Fenvironmental performance".
